exemplar.en:
Handover. Button state map repair, policy DS-07.

Three states breached the contract. hover returned TOKENS.actionBg, so it rendered #0b5cad instead of the published hover value #084a8c. focus-visible set outline to 'none', removing the visible focus indicator. disabled returned the action tokens with opacity '0.5', instead of --color-disabled-bg #d5dae0 on --color-disabled-fg #5b6570 with cursor 'not-allowed'.

Corrected function.
```ts
export type ButtonState = 'default' | 'hover' | 'focus-visible' | 'disabled'

export const TOKENS = {
  actionBg: 'var(--color-action-bg)',
  actionFg: 'var(--color-action-fg)',
  actionBgHover: 'var(--color-action-bg-hover)',
  focusRing: 'var(--color-focus-ring)',
  disabledBg: 'var(--color-disabled-bg)',
  disabledFg: 'var(--color-disabled-fg)',
  space1: 'var(--space-1)'
} as const

export function getButtonStyle(state: ButtonState) {
  switch (state) {
    case 'default':
      return { background: TOKENS.actionBg, color: TOKENS.actionFg }
    case 'hover':
      return { background: TOKENS.actionBgHover, color: TOKENS.actionFg }
    case 'focus-visible':
      return { background: TOKENS.actionBg, color: TOKENS.actionFg, outline: '2px solid ' + TOKENS.focusRing, outlineOffset: TOKENS.space1 }
    case 'disabled':
      return { background: TOKENS.disabledBg, color: TOKENS.disabledFg, cursor: 'not-allowed' }
  }
}
```

Horizontal space. --space-4 is 16px on each side plus the 2px transparent border on each side, giving 16 + 16 + 2 + 2 = 36px.

Proposed tests. Assert hover background equals 'var(--color-action-bg-hover)'. Assert focus-visible outline equals '2px solid var(--color-focus-ring)' with offset 'var(--space-1)'. Assert disabled has no opacity key and uses the two disabled tokens plus cursor 'not-allowed'. Assert default and hover keep 'var(--color-action-fg)'. Assert no returned value matches a hex pattern.

Limitations. No code was executed and no browser ran. Contrast and real focus visibility were not measured and disabled focusability was not tested. Escalate any state outside DS-07 to the design system owner.

exemplar.zh:
交接。Button 狀態樣式表修正，政策 DS-07。

三個狀態違反合約。hover 回傳 TOKENS.actionBg，因此渲染出 #0b5cad 而非已發布的 hover 值 #084a8c。focus-visible 把 outline 設為 'none'，移除了可見焦點指示。disabled 回傳 action 標記並加上 opacity '0.5'，而非使用 --color-disabled-bg #d5dae0 配 --color-disabled-fg #5b6570 及 cursor 'not-allowed'。

修正後函數。
```ts
export type ButtonState = 'default' | 'hover' | 'focus-visible' | 'disabled'

export const TOKENS = {
  actionBg: 'var(--color-action-bg)',
  actionFg: 'var(--color-action-fg)',
  actionBgHover: 'var(--color-action-bg-hover)',
  focusRing: 'var(--color-focus-ring)',
  disabledBg: 'var(--color-disabled-bg)',
  disabledFg: 'var(--color-disabled-fg)',
  space1: 'var(--space-1)'
} as const

export function getButtonStyle(state: ButtonState) {
  switch (state) {
    case 'default':
      return { background: TOKENS.actionBg, color: TOKENS.actionFg }
    case 'hover':
      return { background: TOKENS.actionBgHover, color: TOKENS.actionFg }
    case 'focus-visible':
      return { background: TOKENS.actionBg, color: TOKENS.actionFg, outline: '2px solid ' + TOKENS.focusRing, outlineOffset: TOKENS.space1 }
    case 'disabled':
      return { background: TOKENS.disabledBg, color: TOKENS.disabledFg, cursor: 'not-allowed' }
  }
}
```

水平空間。--space-4 每側為 16px，加上每側 2px 透明外框，即 16 + 16 + 2 + 2 = 36px。

建議測試。斷言 hover 背景等於 'var(--color-action-bg-hover)'。斷言 focus-visible 的 outline 等於 '2px solid var(--color-focus-ring)'，偏移為 'var(--space-1)'。斷言 disabled 不含 opacity 鍵，並使用兩個 disabled 標記及 cursor 'not-allowed'。斷言 default 及 hover 保留 'var(--color-action-fg)'。斷言沒有任何回傳值符合十六進制格式。

限制。沒有執行程式碼，亦沒有瀏覽器運行。未量度對比度及真實焦點可見度，亦未測試 disabled 的可聚焦性。DS-07 以外的狀態須轉交設計系統負責人。

