exemplar.en:
Decision. The map breaches DS-12 in four ways, so I return one complete self-contained module. success used the info border token, warning used role 'status' with a forbidden ariaLive and the info label key, and danger used the warning text token with a forbidden ariaLive.

```ts
export type AlertSeverity = 'info' | 'success' | 'warning' | 'danger'

export const TOKENS = {
  infoBg: 'var(--color-info-bg)',
  infoFg: 'var(--color-info-fg)',
  infoBorder: 'var(--color-info-border)',
  successBg: 'var(--color-success-bg)',
  successFg: 'var(--color-success-fg)',
  successBorder: 'var(--color-success-border)',
  warningBg: 'var(--color-warning-bg)',
  warningFg: 'var(--color-warning-fg)',
  warningBorder: 'var(--color-warning-border)',
  dangerBg: 'var(--color-danger-bg)',
  dangerFg: 'var(--color-danger-fg)',
  dangerBorder: 'var(--color-danger-border)'
} as const

export const LABELS = {
  info: 'alert.label.info',
  success: 'alert.label.success',
  warning: 'alert.label.warning',
  danger: 'alert.label.danger'
} as const

export function getAlertStyle(severity: AlertSeverity) {
  switch (severity) {
    case 'info':
      return { background: TOKENS.infoBg, color: TOKENS.infoFg, border: '1px solid ' + TOKENS.infoBorder, role: 'status', labelKey: LABELS.info }
    case 'success':
      return { background: TOKENS.successBg, color: TOKENS.successFg, border: '1px solid ' + TOKENS.successBorder, role: 'status', labelKey: LABELS.success }
    case 'warning':
      return { background: TOKENS.warningBg, color: TOKENS.warningFg, border: '1px solid ' + TOKENS.warningBorder, role: 'alert', labelKey: LABELS.warning }
    case 'danger':
      return { background: TOKENS.dangerBg, color: TOKENS.dangerFg, border: '1px solid ' + TOKENS.dangerBorder, role: 'alert', labelKey: LABELS.danger }
  }
}
```

Evidence. DS-12 fixes the role per severity, bans ariaLive and raw hex, and requires each severity's own background, text and border tokens plus its own labelKey. The token table supplies those values and the spacing tokens.

Verification cases, all paper checks. getAlertStyle('info') and getAlertStyle('success') return role 'status' while warning and danger return role 'alert'. No returned object owns an ariaLive key. No returned border string starts with '#'. A lint rule rejecting hex literals keeps the map token driven. Layout check, horizontal padding 12 + 12 plus border 1 + 1 gives 26 px around the content.

Limits. Nothing was executed. Contrast ratios, rendered layout and the screen reader announcement from the i18n label text stay untested. Next step, Ada Cheung owns the merge and the design system reviewer confirms the DS-12 wording.

exemplar.zh:
決定。此對應有四個地方違反 DS-12，因此提交一個完整、可獨立執行的模組。success 使用了 info 外框標記，warning 使用 role 'status' 並加入被禁的 ariaLive，且用上 info 標籤鍵，danger 使用 warning 文字標記並加入被禁的 ariaLive。

```ts
export type AlertSeverity = 'info' | 'success' | 'warning' | 'danger'

export const TOKENS = {
  infoBg: 'var(--color-info-bg)',
  infoFg: 'var(--color-info-fg)',
  infoBorder: 'var(--color-info-border)',
  successBg: 'var(--color-success-bg)',
  successFg: 'var(--color-success-fg)',
  successBorder: 'var(--color-success-border)',
  warningBg: 'var(--color-warning-bg)',
  warningFg: 'var(--color-warning-fg)',
  warningBorder: 'var(--color-warning-border)',
  dangerBg: 'var(--color-danger-bg)',
  dangerFg: 'var(--color-danger-fg)',
  dangerBorder: 'var(--color-danger-border)'
} as const

export const LABELS = {
  info: 'alert.label.info',
  success: 'alert.label.success',
  warning: 'alert.label.warning',
  danger: 'alert.label.danger'
} as const

export function getAlertStyle(severity: AlertSeverity) {
  switch (severity) {
    case 'info':
      return { background: TOKENS.infoBg, color: TOKENS.infoFg, border: '1px solid ' + TOKENS.infoBorder, role: 'status', labelKey: LABELS.info }
    case 'success':
      return { background: TOKENS.successBg, color: TOKENS.successFg, border: '1px solid ' + TOKENS.successBorder, role: 'status', labelKey: LABELS.success }
    case 'warning':
      return { background: TOKENS.warningBg, color: TOKENS.warningFg, border: '1px solid ' + TOKENS.warningBorder, role: 'alert', labelKey: LABELS.warning }
    case 'danger':
      return { background: TOKENS.dangerBg, color: TOKENS.dangerFg, border: '1px solid ' + TOKENS.dangerBorder, role: 'alert', labelKey: LABELS.danger }
  }
}
```

證據。DS-12 釘定每個嚴重程度的角色，禁止 ariaLive 及原始十六進制色值，並要求每個嚴重程度使用本身的背景、文字及外框標記，以及本身的 labelKey。標記表提供這些數值及間距標記。

核實個案，全部為紙本檢查。getAlertStyle('info') 及 getAlertStyle('success') 回傳 role 'status'，warning 及 danger 回傳 role 'alert'。任何回傳物件都不含 ariaLive 鍵。任何回傳外框字串都不以 '#' 開頭。以 lint 規則拒絕十六進制字面可保持對應由標記驅動。排版檢查，左右內距 12 + 12 加上外框 1 + 1，即內容周邊 26 px。

限制。未執行任何程式碼。對比度、實際排版及由 i18n 標籤文字產生的螢幕閱讀器播報仍未測試。下一步，由 Ada Cheung 負責合併，設計系統審查員確認 DS-12 文字。

