}
```

Why it fixes the defect: It returns null for validation_failed and duplicate. It emits exactly one event for accepted, sourcing the five canonical fields from the result and only note from the request.

Evidence: CSV rows c1, c3, c5 are accepted. Their resultPriceCents are 1200, 1800, 900, total 3900 cents.

