exemplar.en:
Decision: the only defect in checkFilename is the duplicated second cascade, which recomputes the same trimmed, lowercased values as the first one and therefore never changes a verdict. Replacement:

```ts
export type Verdict = 'empty' | 'unsupported-extension' | 'name-too-long' | 'accepted';

const MAX_BASE_LENGTH = 40;
const ALLOWED_EXTENSIONS: ReadonlySet<string> = new Set(['png', 'jpg', 'webp']);

export function checkFilename(raw: string): Verdict {
  const normalised = raw.trim().toLowerCase();
  if (normalised.length === 0) {
    return 'empty';
  }
  const dot = normalised.lastIndexOf('.');
  if (dot < 1) {
    return 'unsupported-extension';
  }
  if (!ALLOWED_EXTENSIONS.has(normalised.slice(dot + 1))) {
    return 'unsupported-extension';
  }
  return normalised.slice(0, dot).length > MAX_BASE_LENGTH ? 'name-too-long' : 'accepted';
}
```

Verdicts from policy-eligibility: fn-01 accepted, fn-02 accepted, fn-03 accepted, fn-04 unsupported-extension, fn-05 unsupported-extension, fn-06 unsupported-extension, fn-07 name-too-long, fn-08 accepted, fn-09 empty, fn-10 unsupported-extension, fn-11 unsupported-extension. Accepted count is 4. '  a.B.PNG  ' is accepted because the last dot is the one before 'png'. The padded uppercase string ending in '.TIFF' returns 'unsupported-extension' because the extension check precedes the length check. Tests: the eleven rows above, base lengths 40 and 41, '.png', 'README' and 'notes.toString'. The Set membership test replaces the explicit comparisons so the guard still rejects inherited names. Limitation: every rule, trace and review here is fictional, no code was executed and no production upload path is implied. Next step: Ada Cheung confirms the suite passes before merge.

exemplar.zh:
決定：checkFilename 的唯一缺陷是重複的第二段流程，它重算與第一段相同的去空白及小寫數值，因此從不改變判定。替代版本：

```ts
export type Verdict = 'empty' | 'unsupported-extension' | 'name-too-long' | 'accepted';

const MAX_BASE_LENGTH = 40;
const ALLOWED_EXTENSIONS: ReadonlySet<string> = new Set(['png', 'jpg', 'webp']);

export function checkFilename(raw: string): Verdict {
  const normalised = raw.trim().toLowerCase();
  if (normalised.length === 0) {
    return 'empty';
  }
  const dot = normalised.lastIndexOf('.');
  if (dot < 1) {
    return 'unsupported-extension';
  }
  if (!ALLOWED_EXTENSIONS.has(normalised.slice(dot + 1))) {
    return 'unsupported-extension';
  }
  return normalised.slice(0, dot).length > MAX_BASE_LENGTH ? 'name-too-long' : 'accepted';
}
```

依 policy-eligibility 得出的判定：fn-01 accepted、fn-02 accepted、fn-03 accepted、fn-04 unsupported-extension、fn-05 unsupported-extension、fn-06 unsupported-extension、fn-07 name-too-long、fn-08 accepted、fn-09 empty、fn-10 unsupported-extension、fn-11 unsupported-extension。accepted 數目為 4。'  a.B.PNG  ' 為 accepted，因最後一個點就是 'png' 之前的那個。補上空白及大寫、結尾為 '.TIFF' 的字串回傳 'unsupported-extension'，因副檔名檢查先於長度檢查。測試：上述十一列、主檔名長度 40 及 41、'.png'、'README' 及 'notes.toString'。以 Set 成員測試取代明確比較，檢查仍能拒絕繼承名稱。限制：此處所有規則、追蹤及審查均為虛構，沒有執行程式碼，亦不涉及任何生產上載路徑。下一步：由 Ada Cheung 確認測試套件通過後才合併。

