exemplar.en:
Handover: legacy count migration, fictional simulation in an Oursky-inspired studio, not an endorsement.
Decision: the shipped toNewRecord reads only qty, so it breaks the published precedence in R3. Replace the resolution logic.
```ts
function finiteOrNull(value: number | undefined): number | null {
  return typeof value === 'number' && Number.isFinite(value) ? value : null;
}

export function toNewRecord(record: LegacyRecord): NewRecord {
  const quantity = finiteOrNull(record.quantity) ?? finiteOrNull(record.qty) ?? 0;
  return { id: record.id, quantity };
}
```
Evidence: p-02 has no qty and quantity 12, so the shipped version returns 0 instead of 12. p-03 has quantity 0, which is finite, so 0 must win over qty 4, yet the shipped version returns 4. p-05 has quantity 9 and qty 3, so 9, yet the shipped version returns 3. p-01 stays 7 and p-04 stays 0. Resolved values are 7, 12, 0, 0, 9, total 28 units.
Tests: assert each resolved value by id, assert 0 when only quantity 0 exists, assert 0 when both fields are absent, and assert the input object is unchanged after the call.
Limits: only the five supplied fixtures were analysed, no code was executed, and no database or SQL work is in scope. Proposed next step is to send this patch to team lead Vivian Lau for review before merge.

exemplar.zh:
交接：舊版數量遷移，此為受 Oursky 啟發的工作室內的虛構模擬，並非認可。
決定：受審的 toNewRecord 只讀取 qty，違反已公布 R3 的優先次序。須更換解析邏輯。
```ts
function finiteOrNull(value: number | undefined): number | null {
  return typeof value === 'number' && Number.isFinite(value) ? value : null;
}

export function toNewRecord(record: LegacyRecord): NewRecord {
  const quantity = finiteOrNull(record.quantity) ?? finiteOrNull(record.qty) ?? 0;
  return { id: record.id, quantity };
}
```
證據：p-02 無 qty 而 quantity 為 12，現有版本回傳 0 而非 12。p-03 的 quantity 為 0，屬有限數字，必須優先於 qty 4，但現有版本回傳 4。p-05 的 quantity 為 9、qty 為 3，應回傳 9，但現有版本回傳 3。p-01 維持 7，p-04 維持 0。解析值為 7、12、0、0、9，總和 28 個單位。
測試：按 id 斷言上述解析值；只有 quantity 為 0 時斷言 0；兩欄皆無時斷言 0；並斷言呼叫後輸入物件不被改動。
限制：只分析了所提供的五筆資料，沒有執行程式碼，亦不涉及資料庫或 SQL 工作。建議下一步是把此修正交予團隊主管 Vivian Lau 於合併前審查。
